
% Breathe

a: ii | I | IV | I |
a_cad: ii | I | IV |
aa: $a $a_cad
In: $a $a_cad
turnaround: ii | V |
Vr: $a $a_cad $a $turnaround
b: I | ii | IV | V |
bb: I | ii | IV | I |
Ch: $b*2 $bb $turnaround
link: $b*2
turnaround_2: IV | I | ii | V |
Ch_2: $bb $turnaround
ending: $bb $a $a_cad
S: [G] $In $Vr*2 $Ch $link $Vr $Ch $turnaround_2 $link $Ch_2 $turnaround_2 $ending
